<title>USA: Chiyoda, Kellogg form ethylene alliance.</title>
<headline>Chiyoda, Kellogg form ethylene alliance.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>M.W. Kellogg Co said Monday it formed a global alliance to pursue and execute ethylene projects with Chiyoda Corp.</p>
<p>Kellogg, a Dresser Industries Inc subsidiary, said its proprietary Millisecond furnace and recovery section technologies are the cornerstones of the alliance which combines both companies' engineering, procurement and construction capabilities.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
